  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF - Better Diets for Better Growth fase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will gether new insight and knowledge about food systems and how they affect diets for children in developing countries. UNICEF will address knowledge gaps at the global level and regional level. This project will also aid priority countries in the roll-out, implementation and monitoring of policies, programmes and strategies to improving the quality of children&#x2019;s diets, food environments, and food and feeding behaviours to achieve our vision for a world where all children and adolescents realize their right to nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
